{1 = 1-10}
10=1.	The Tamarisk opened his mouth and spoke. 
14=2.	He addressed the Date Palm: 
18=3.	@q[Tamarisk,Date Palm]{“My body … 
22=4.	… the bodies of the gods. 
26=5.	@noteref{The reference is to statues of tamarisk wood.} You grow your fruits but someone places  
30=6.	them before me like a maid approaching her mistress. 
34=7.	You do not provide the measuring vessels. 
