{11 = 11-19}
50=11.	In his anger the Date Palm answered him. 
54=12.	He addressed his brother the Tamarisk: 
58=13.	@q[Date Palm,Tamarisk]{“You say: 
62=14.	@q[Tamarisk,Date Palm]{“If people build daises for me and beautify them too, 
